[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:The Man in a Hat]
[00:00.78]Lesson 121 | 第121课
[00:03.71]The man in a hat  | 戴帽子的男人
[00:06.70]Listen to the tape then answer this question.  | 听录音，然后回答问题。
[00:12.32]Why didn't Caroline recognize the customer straight away?  | 为什么卡罗琳没有立刻认出这位顾客？
[00:19.37]I bought two expensive dictionaries here half an hour ago, but I forgot to take them with me.  | 半小时前我在这儿买了词典，可是我忘记把它们带走了。
[00:30.00]Who served you, sir?  | 是谁为您服务的，先生？
[00:33.38]The lady who is standing behind the counter.  | 是那位站在柜台后面的女士。
[00:37.22]Which books did you buy?  | 您买的是哪些书？
[00:40.95]The books which are on the counter.  | 是柜台上的那些书。
[00:44.44]Did you serve this gentleman half an hour ago, Caroline?  | 半小时前你为这位先生服务过吗，卡罗琳？
[00:49.98]He says he's the man who bought these books.  | 他说他就是买这些书的人。
[00:54.39]I can't remember.  | 我记不起来了。
[00:57.04]The man who I served was wearing a hat.  | 我为之服务的那个人戴着一顶帽子。
[01:01.81]Have you got a hat, sir?  | 您有帽子吗，先生？
[01:05.50]Yes, I have.  | 是的，我有。
[01:07.69]Would you put it on, please?  | 请您戴上好吗？
[01:10.66]All right.  | 好的。
[01:12.13]Is this the man that you served, Caroline?  | 卡罗琳，这就是您为之服务过的那个人吗？
[01:16.62]Yes.  | 是的。
[01:18.32]I recognize him now.  | 我现在认出他了。